{"type":"Film","id":"FR2016_088","slug":"fr2016-088-ils-sont-partout","title":{"native":"Ils sont partout","english":"The Jews"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-06-01","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Yvan Attal","slug":"yvan-attal","name":"Yvan Attal","birthYear":1965,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/153/115/160665/format_page/ils-sont-partout.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gXtvFqPQwR0"},"synopsis":{"native":"Yvan se sent persécuté par un antisémitisme grandissant et il a l’habitude de s’entendre dire qu’il exagère, qu’il est paranoïaque. Lors de séances chez son psy, Yvan parle donc de ce qui le concerne : son identité, être français et juif aujourd’hui. Mais ces rendez-vous sont aussi et surtout une sorte de fil rouge reliant entre elles plusieurs histoires courtes qui tentent de démonter, sur le mode tragi-comique, les clichés antisémites les plus tenaces !","english":"Yvan feels persecuted by an antisemitism increasingly on the rise and he is used to hearing that he exaggerates and is paranoiac. During sessions with his shrink, Yvan talks about the things that worry him: his identity, being French and Jewish today. But these sessions are also and above all a through line linking several short stories that try to show, in a tragicomic way, the most tenacious antisemitic clichés!"},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Alain Fromager","slug":"alain-fromager","name":"Alain Fromager","birthYear":1960,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Antoine de Caunes","slug":"antoine-de-caunes","name":"Antoine de Caunes","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","national